        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/2026-10-27-bauhinia-variegata-turing-wavelength-s0-audit-v2-delphi10000-bauhinia-variegata-turing-wavelength-s0-11>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/2026-10-27-bauhinia-variegata-turing-wavelength-s0-audit-v2-delphi10000-bauhinia-variegata-turing-wavelength-s0-12>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/2026-10-27-bauhinia-variegata-turing-wavelength-s0-audit-v2-delphi10000-bauhinia-variegata-turing-wavelength-s0-13>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/2026-10-27-bauhinia-variegata-turing-wavelength-s0-audit-v2-delphi10000-bauhinia-variegata-turing-wavelength-s0-14>,
